                <note rend="inline" type="source">714.44A15/133: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Minister in Guatemala</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Des Portes</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1940-02-27T19:00:00-05:00">February 27, 1940—7
                        p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>11. Your no. 22, February 26, 11 a.m. You may inform President Ubico that his
                    suggestion with regard to the Belize negotiations will be transmitted to Mr.
                    Welles.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
